OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 JUN
OL,4,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,5,     GCerys marks World Ocean Day with
OL,6,     GHelen Czerski and Nadia Frontier,
OL,7,     Gexploring ocean currents,
OL,8,     GAntarctic wildlife sounds, and
OL,9,     Gmusic inspired by the sea.
OL,10,G1300FGuy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,11,     GGuy talks to New Jersey-born,
OL,12,     GManchester-based singer-
OL,13,     Gsongwriter Run Remedy and salutes
OL,14,     Gmusical explorers, including
OL,15,     Gfeatured artists TV On The Radio.
OL,16,G1600FJohn Cooper Clarke
OL,17,     GJohn hits up the jukebox armed
OL,18,     Gwith a bag-o-dimes. Expect old-
OL,19,     Gschool nuggets from the likes of
OL,20,     GThe Hombres, France Gall, David
OL,21,     GJohansen, The Cramps, Nancy
OL,22,     GSinatra and Iggy Pop.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
